This module ships an unmodified copy of the scrcpy server:

    scrcpy-server.jar     scrcpy v3.3.1
    https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/releases/tag/v3.3.1
    sha256 in scrcpy-server.sha256, verified before every start

Copyright (C) 2018 Genymobile
Copyright (C) 2018-2025 Romain Vimont

Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0; the full text is in
LICENSE.scrcpy beside this file. Rackphone itself is MIT (../../../LICENSE.md),
and the two are compatible - which is why the notice is here rather than the
jar being repackaged.

The version is pinned because the server's protocol is private and shifts
between releases: action.sh names the same version it verifies, and the client
parses that version's framing. Upgrading means changing all three together.
